        "ver": "1.0.0",
        "Node name for S&R": "ShowText|pysssss"
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "integrated_multimodal_description:\n\n[Shot 1]\nA wide establishing shot of a dense, misty prehistoric valley at dusk, tall ferns and towering conifers framing both sides of the frame. From the right treeline, a colossal Tyrannosaurus rex strides into the clearing, olive-brown scaled hide rippling as its jaws part in a thunderous roar, teeth glinting in the dim light. A squad of five human soldiers in modern tactical gear scrambles backward toward the left, weapons half-raised, dust pluming beneath their boots. The camera dollies left, tracking the soldiers' retreat while keeping the charging beast in frame. The T-Rex drives one massive clawed foot into the mud, cracking the earth and shaking the undergrowth. A squad leader near center-frame, gripping his rifle with both hands, shouts commands to his unit.\n<d>[English] Rally on me! Open fire on that thing!</d>\n<scenetrans>\n\n[Shot 2] At 00:03.500\n<scenetrans> The squad leader's command continues unbroken across the cut. Cut to a tight, low-angle tracking shot from behind a kneeling soldier. The T-Rex lunges forward, jaws snapping shut as another soldier dives out of frame to the left. Two kneeling soldiers on the right fire assault rifles in controlled bursts, bright muzzle flashes strobing across the dinosaur's scarred chest. The camera pushes forward rapidly as the beast roars again, hot breath and saliva distorting the air. A clawed foot slams down inches from the lens, shaking the frame as dust and debris erupt into the lens.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nDeep, humid jungle ambience fills the air, mixing with distant prehistoric bird calls, rustling fern fronds, and the wet, heavy thud of a massive clawed foot breaking the muddy ground. Frantic shouts and ragged breathing from the soldiers mingle with the metallic clatter of rifles and rapid bursts of gunfire, while a guttural, bone-shaking Tyrannosaurus roar reverberates through the valley, punctuated by the sharp wet snap of its snapping jaws.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nA driving, high-tempo orchestral score built on pounding taiko-style drums, deep brass stabs, and a pulsing low synth bass, escalating in intensity throughout to underscore the escalating clash between beast and soldiers."
      ]
    },
